    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "그런 짓을 할 만큼 어리석지는 않다",
      "text": "I am not such a fool[so <b>foolish</b>] as to do so. or I know better (than to do so)."
